    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.swingtrade.rolling-tail</string>

    <!-- Pass 3 · rolling-tail warm (cheap layer only) · every 45 min in-session
         (6:30 AM-12:30 PM PT, Mon-Fri = 9 slots/day).

         Warms the TAIL (universe - hot-set - strategy-picks, ~2,100 names) in
         batches of ~150, advancing through a 12h-TTL state file so successive
         runs converge the whole tail by EOD. CHEAP layer only:
           - Finviz bulk fundamentals (prefetched once/run, 4h-cached, reused
             per name - never re-scraped per ticker)
           - daily bars ARCHIVE-FIRST (local Parquet read, zero API; EODHD delta
             only for names missing from the archive)
         DEFERRED to on-click: 4H Schwab, EW weekly/monthly, full structural
         targets, options - too expensive to compute for the tail; the FastAPI
         endpoints warm those on first click.

         Runs under /usr/bin/nice -n 15 (low CPU priority) AND is HEAVY-labeled
         in launchd_wrapper.sh, so guard_heavy_job.sh skips the run cleanly if a
         swing scan or another heavy job is active - it yields to scan/load.
         Client rate-limiters handle the rare missing-archive EODHD delta. -->
    <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
    <array>
        <dict><key>Hour</key><integer>6</integer><key>Minute</key><integer>30</integer><key>Weekday</key><integer>1</integer></dict>
